WEBVTT

00:09:29.635 --> 00:09:32.724
We've met champions all over the public sector

00:09:32.724 --> 00:09:35.139
keen to make these kinds of differences.

00:09:35.139 --> 00:09:36.924
With this kind of model,

00:09:36.924 --> 00:09:38.860
we can help bring them together.

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:40.822
Thank you.

00:09:40.822 --> 00:09:45.022
(Applause)